    "ImpactRecovery": {
      "description": "v0.7 - Table 6 #21, the quantitative half: how much of one impact category\nthe end-of-life route can avoid.\n\nWHY THIS EXISTS: `RecoveryPotential.credits` is per MATERIAL and single-category\n(climate). The AR client needs per IMPACT CATEGORY across scenarios, because the\nthesis result is that the scenarios answer different environmental questions -\nreuse pays in carbon, dismantling-for-smelting pays in minerals. A single\n\"recovery rate\" without a named scenario and category is not interpretable.\n\nPopulate from LCA_Analysis/Outputs/3_impact_assessment/impact_EF31.csv\n(`sc1`, `sc*_net`, `sc*_saving`) - never from mc_net.csv, whose independent\nsampling understates the scenario gaps.",
      "properties": {
        "category": {
          "title": "Category",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "unit": {
          "title": "Unit",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "screening_share_pct": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Screening Share Pct"
        },
        "baseline": {
          "title": "Baseline",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "baseline_scenario": {
          "default": "Sc1",
          "title": "Baseline Scenario",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "scenarios": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/ImpactRecoveryScenario"
          },
          "title": "Scenarios",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "method": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Method"
        },
        "basis": {
          "default": "not_provided",
          "title": "Basis",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "category",
        "unit",
        "baseline"
      ],
      "title": "ImpactRecovery",
      "type": "object"
    },
